    "citations": [
      "1643"
    ]
  },
  {
    "statement": "Two studies in the UK found that herbicide application did not reduce grass cover.",
    "citations": [
      "1643"
    ]
  },
  {
    "statement": "Herbicide can be combined with seeding shrubland plants.",
